{"path":"error/static_assert","title":"static_assert","titleHtml":"static_assert","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/error/static_assert","section":"error","kind":"page","summary":"This convenience macro expands to the keyword _Static_assert.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/error\"><code>&lt;assert.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11 t-until-c23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define static_assert _Static_assert</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c23\">(removed in C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>This convenience macro expands to the keyword <a href=\"/w/c/keyword/_Static_assert\"><code>_Static_assert</code></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;assert.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"2+2 isn't 4\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>   <span class=\"co1\">// well-formed</span>\n&nbsp;\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">sizeof</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">sizeof</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,   <span class=\"co1\">// compile-time error</span>\n                  <span class=\"st0\">\"this program requires that int is less than char\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Since C23, <a href=\"/w/c/language/_Static_assert\"><code>static_assert</code></a> is itself a keyword, which may also be a predefined macro, so <a href=\"/w/c/error\"><code>&lt;assert.h&gt;</code></a> no longer provides it.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.2/3 Diagnostics &lt;assert.h&gt; (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.2/3 Diagnostics &lt;assert.h&gt; (p: 135)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.2/3 Diagnostics &lt;assert.h&gt; (p: 186)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/static_assert\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span><span>Static Assertion</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"error","title":"Error handling"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"static_assert","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. This convenience macro expands to the keyword _Static_assert."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"Notes","note":"Since C23, static_assert is itself a keyword, which may also be a predefined macro, so <assert.h> no longer provides it."},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C11","C23"],"wordCount":108,"codeBlockCount":1}
